5,0,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Let's get this started. Since we have zero information on day zero, I suggest we all just observe each other's patterns. I'll be watching closely to see who trips over their own words.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,George,,"That sounds like a sensible approach, Shunichi. I agree that observation is our best tool for now. I shall keep a quiet eye on the proceedings and see how everyone carries themselves.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Yumi,,Hello everyone! I'm so happy to be playing with you all! I agree with you both; let's just be friendly and see how things go. I'll do my best to help the village!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"I'm ready! I'll find the werewolf and protect everyone, no matter what it takes. Let's just keep talking and see who's acting weird. I'm not letting the werewolf win!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Good evening, everyone. I agree with the sentiment of a calm start. Let us observe each other with a peaceful mind and see what the coming days reveal.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Yumi, your enthusiasm is charming, but let's not forget we're hunting a predator. @Takumi, your passion is a bit loud, isn't it? Try to keep your head so you don't lead us astray.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,George,,"Now, now, Shunichi. There is no need to be so stern. Takumi's energy is simply a sign of his commitment. Let us all remain patient and avoid jumping to conclusions so early in the game.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Shunichi, you're right! I'll make sure to stay focused while keeping things positive. @George, thank you for being so kind! I think we can all get along and find the werewolf together!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Shunichi, I'm not being loud, I'm being serious! I can keep my head just fine. I'm the one who's going to catch the werewolf while you're just watching!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,It seems we have a spirited debate already. Let us not let our emotions cloud our judgment. A gentle approach often reveals more than a loud one.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Takumi, your eagerness to prove yourself is almost endearing. Just be careful that your desire to ""catch"" the werewolf doesn't turn into a blind guess. I'll be here to correct you if you do.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,George,,I believe we are spending a bit too much energy on these small frictions. Let us return to the goal at hand. I will continue to observe from the sidelines and reflect on our words.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Yumi,,"I agree with George! Let's not fight. We're all on the same team, right? I'm sure if we just keep talking and being honest, the truth will come out naturally! Let's all do our best!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Shunichi, stop talking down to me! I'm not guessing, I'm paying attention. If you're so smart, then just watch me find the werewolf. I'm not backing down!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,It is truly a pity to see such tension so early. Let us remember that harmony is the key to clarity. I shall continue to listen and reflect on everyone's words in silence.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Shunichi,,"It seems we've established the dynamics of the group quite quickly. I'll be content to wait for the Seer's first lead tomorrow. Until then, I'll keep my eyes on all of you.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Shunichi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,George,,I believe we have seen enough for today. I shall spend the night reflecting on these interactions. I am ready to move forward.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,George,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Yumi,,I've had a great time getting to know everyone today! I hope we can all stay friends while we solve this mystery. Good luck to everyone tonight!,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Yumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Takumi,,"I'm not done yet, but I guess we have to stop. Just remember, I'm watching all of you! I'll find the werewolf tomorrow!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Takumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,I wish you all a peaceful night. I shall retire to my thoughts and await the dawn with a quiet heart.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
29,0,4,pass,Jonathan,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
