36,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Good morning. Now that the first night has passed, the real game begins. Does anyone have any information they'd like to share, or are we still playing the guessing game?","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,George,,"I believe it is time for the Seer to speak, if they feel it is safe to do so. A clear lead now would save us from unnecessary mistakes. I am listening.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"I'm a little nervous, but I want to help everyone! I'm the Seer, and I checked Shunichi last night. He's human! I'm so glad we have someone we can trust right from the start!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"@Yumi, you're the Seer? That was fast! I'm glad Shunichi is human, but we can't just relax. We still have to find the werewolf! Who else do you think is suspicious?","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"@Yumi, thank you for sharing your findings so quickly. It is a relief to know that Shunichi is human. Let us maintain this composure as we consider our next steps.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Yumi, claiming the Seer role so early is a bold move. While I appreciate being cleared, it's a classic strategy for a werewolf to gain trust by ""confirming"" a villager. I'll trust you for now, but I'm watching.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,George,,"@Shunichi, your caution is wise, but let us not be overly cynical. If Yumi is indeed the Seer, her honesty is a gift to the village. However, we must consider if this is too convenient a start.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Shunichi, I understand why you're cautious, but I really just want us to win! I promise I'm telling the truth. I hope you can believe me so we can all work together to save the village!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Shunichi, stop being so suspicious! Yumi is just trying to help us. If she's the Seer, we should trust her so we can actually find the werewolf instead of arguing about everything!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"It is natural to feel a sense of doubt, but perhaps we can find a middle ground. If we trust Yumi's word for now, we can move forward with a sense of unity rather than suspicion.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Takumi, your blind faith is almost as loud as your voice. @Yumi, if you're the Seer, you've given us a starting point, but you haven't given us a target. Who else have you been eyeing, or are you just playing the ""nice girl"" role?","{""words"":44,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,George,,"@Shunichi, please temper your tone. Yumi has only had one night to divine. It is unreasonable to expect a target immediately. Let us give her a moment to think and speak without being pressured.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Shunichi, I'm not playing a role, I really just want everyone to be safe! I only had one night to check, so I don't have a target yet. But I'll do my very best to find the werewolf tonight!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Shunichi, you're just being mean for no reason! Yumi is trying her best, and you're just attacking her! If you're so smart, why don't you tell us who you think the werewolf is instead of just complaining?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"It is disheartening to see such conflict. @Takumi, @Shunichi, please. Let us not let our frustrations blind us. If we spend our time attacking one another, we only create a sanctuary for the werewolf to hide in.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"@Takumi, I'm not complaining; I'm analyzing. If we blindly follow Yumi's kindness, we're just walking into a trap. Since we have no one to execute with certainty, I'll vote based on who's acting most out of character.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
52,1,4,pass,Shunichi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
53,1,4,talk,George,,"I find myself agreeing with Jonathan. This bickering is counterproductive. Since Yumi has cleared Shunichi and we have no other evidence, I believe we should avoid a rash execution today. I shall vote carefully.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Yumi"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
54,1,4,pass,George,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
55,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"I'm sorry that everyone is fighting! I really hope we can all just be friends and work together. Since I don't have a werewolf yet, I'll trust you all to make the right choice. I believe in us!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
56,1,4,pass,Yumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
57,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"@Shunichi, you're just making excuses now! You're the one causing all the trouble. I'm not letting you bully Yumi. I'll vote for whoever is actually acting like a werewolf, and right now, you're the most annoying!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
58,1,4,pass,Takumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
59,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"It is a sorrowful end to our first day. While the tension between Shunichi and Takumi is palpable, we must not let anger dictate our vote. I shall cast my ballot with a quiet heart, hoping for the village's peace.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
60,1,4,pass,Jonathan,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
