74,2,1,talk,George,,"It is a somber start to the day. Shunichi was executed, yet we have no confirmation that he was the werewolf. I hope for all our sakes that we did not just eliminate a fellow villager due to a clash of personalities.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,1,talk,Yumi,,"It's so sad that Shunichi is gone! I really hope he was a villager too, but we have to stay strong for the village. I have more news! I checked George last night, and he's human! We can trust him!","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,2,1,talk,Takumi,,"See! I told you guys we should trust Yumi! Now we know both Shunichi and George are human. That means the werewolf is definitely one of the rest of us. We're getting closer, so don't give up now!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Shunichi"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"It is a comfort to know that George is also human. Yumi, your guidance is becoming a beacon for us in these uncertain times. We must now look closer at the remaining circle with a steady gaze.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""George"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,2,2,talk,George,,"@Yumi, I appreciate your confirmation. It is a relief to be cleared, though I am more concerned with the state of our group. With Shunichi gone and myself cleared, the circle of suspicion narrows significantly.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"@George, you're so welcome! I'm just happy I can help. Since we know you and Shunichi are human, it really does narrow things down! I'll keep doing my best to find the werewolf tonight so we can all be safe!","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""George"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
80,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Yumi, you're doing great! Since George is human and Shunichi is gone, it's just me, Yumi, and Jonathan left. One of us has to be the werewolf! I'm not the werewolf, so it's either Yumi or Jonathan!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""George"",""Shunichi"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
81,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Takumi, your logic is swift, but perhaps too hasty. We must remember that the Possessed also walks among us, masking the werewolf's presence. Let us not rush to judgment and disturb the peace we are trying to build.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
82,2,3,talk,George,,"@Jonathan, you make a valid point. The presence of the Possessed complicates the logic significantly. @Takumi, please slow down. If we rush to accuse Jonathan or Yumi without evidence, we risk another mistake. We must be patient.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Takumi"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
83,2,3,talk,Yumi,,"@George, thank you for reminding us! I agree, we have to be really careful. I don't want anyone else to be executed by mistake. I'll try my absolute hardest to find the werewolf tonight so we can be sure!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
84,2,3,talk,Takumi,,"@George, I'm not rushing, I'm just being honest! If Yumi is the Seer and George is human, then the werewolf has to be one of us. I'm not the werewolf, so it's Jonathan or Yumi! Why are you all protecting them?","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""George"",""Yumi"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
85,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Takumi, I am not seeking protection, but rather clarity. If we simply point fingers without proof, we are no better than the chaos we saw yesterday. Let us trust the Seer's process and wait for the truth to emerge.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
86,2,4,talk,George,,"I believe we have reached a point where patience is our only reliable ally. @Takumi, your frustration is evident, but accusations without proof are dangerous. I shall trust Yumi's divination for tonight and hope for a definitive answer.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
87,2,4,pass,George,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
88,2,4,talk,Yumi,,I'm really hoping for a clear answer tonight so we can finally stop all this fighting! I'll do my very best to find the werewolf and protect everyone. I believe in all of you!,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
89,2,4,pass,Yumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
90,2,4,talk,Takumi,,"I'm not just being frustrated, I'm trying to win! But fine, if you all want to wait for Yumi, we'll wait. Just don't come crying to me if we're too slow! I'm ready to take down the werewolf whenever you are!","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
91,2,4,pass,Takumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
92,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,"It is a relief that we have found a moment of stillness. Let us hope that the night brings the clarity we seek, so that we may resolve this with grace. I shall await the dawn in peace.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
